{"slug":"coding-前python快速複習公式","title":"coding 前python快速複習公式","date":"2024-06-05","updated":"","tags":["Python"],"categories":[],"cover":"/img/cover/cover02.jpg","excerpt":"linknode 好處 插入只要O(1) 壞處 訪問要O(n) full binary tree v.s. complete binary tree 所有使用公式進行排列的時間複雜度 都是 O(nlogn) 方法從列表中移除並返回指定位置的元素，如果不指定索引，則默認移除並返回列表的最後一個元素。 方法在列表的末尾添加一個元素。 方法在指定位置插入元素 方法移除列表中第一次出現的指定元素。 函數用","sticky":99,"contentHtml":"<p>linknode</p>\n<p>好處 插入只要O(1)</p>\n<p>壞處 訪問要O(n)</p>\n<p>full binary tree  v.s. complete binary tree</p>\n<h2 id=\"一些公式函數\"><a href=\"#一些公式函數\">一些公式/函數</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"sort\"><a href=\"#sort\">sort</a></h3>\n<p>所有使用公式進行排列的<strong>時間複雜度 都是 O(nlogn)</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">sorted_numbers </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(numbers)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 逆序排序</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">sorted_numbers_desc </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(numbers, </span><span style=\"color:#E06C75;font-style:italic\">reverse</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">True</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">#對原列表進行</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">5</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">2</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">9</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">5</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">6</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">()</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(numbers)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: [1, 2, 5, 5, 6, 9]</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"pop\"><a href=\"#pop\">pop</a></h3>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>pop()</span></span></code></span> 方法從列表中移除並返回指定位置的元素，如果不指定索引，則默認移除並返回列表的最後一個元素。</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">person </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">25</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"New York\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 移除並返回鍵 \"age\" 對應的值</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">age </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> person.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(age)    </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 25</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(person) </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: {'name': 'Alice', 'city': 'New York'}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 如果鍵不存在，使用默認值</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">city </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> person.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"Unknown\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(city)   </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: New York</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 嘗試移除不存在的鍵，使用默認值</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">country </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> person.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"country\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"Unknown\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(country) </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: Unknown</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"append\"><a href=\"#append\">append</a></h3>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>append()</span></span></code></span> 方法在列表的末尾添加一個元素。</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">10</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">20</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">30</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 在列表末尾添加元素40</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">40</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(numbers)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: [10, 20, 30, 40]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 添加字符串</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">fruits </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"banana\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">fruits.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"cherry\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(fruits)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: [\"apple\", \"banana\", \"cherry\"]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"insert\"><a href=\"#insert\">insert</a></h3>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>insert()</span></span></code></span> 方法在指定位置插入元素</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">10</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">20</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">30</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">40</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">50</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 在索引2處插入25</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">insert</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">2</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">25</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(numbers)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: [10, 20, 25, 30, 40, 50]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"remove\"><a href=\"#remove\">remove</a></h3>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>remove()</span></span></code></span> 方法移除列表中第一次出現的指定元素。</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">10</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">20</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">30</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">40</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">50</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">30</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 移除第一次出現的30</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">remove</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">30</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(numbers)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: [10, 20, 40, 50, 30]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"len\"><a href=\"#len\">len</a></h3>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>len()</span></span></code></span> 函數用來獲取序列（如列表、字典、字符串等）的長度。</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 列表</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">10</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">20</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">30</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">40</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">50</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(numbers))  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 5</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 字符串</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">text </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(text))  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 5</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 字典</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">person </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">25</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"city\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"New York\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(person))  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"set\"><a href=\"#set\">set</a></h3>\n<p>列表轉換為集合</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 原始列表</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">2</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">2</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">3</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">4</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">4</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">5</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 將列表轉換為集合</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">set_numbers</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(numbers)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(set_numbers)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 兩個列表</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">list1 </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">2</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">3</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">4</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">5</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">list2 </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">4</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">5</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">6</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">7</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">8</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 將列表轉換為集合</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">set1 </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(list1)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">set2 </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(list2)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 聯集</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">union_set </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> set1.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">union</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(set2)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(union_set)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 交集</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">intersection_set </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> set1.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">intersection</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(set2)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(intersection_set)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: {4, 5}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 差集</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">difference_set </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> set1.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">difference</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(set2)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(difference_set)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: {1, 2, 3}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>集合轉換回列表</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 集合</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">set_numbers </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">2</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">3</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">4</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">5</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 將集合轉換回列表</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers_list </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> list</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(set_numbers)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(numbers_list)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"enumerate\"><a href=\"#enumerate\">enumerate</a></h3>\n<p>使用 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>enumerate()</span></span></code></span> 獲取索引和值</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">fruits </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"banana\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"cherry\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> index, fruit </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(fruits):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">f</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"Index </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">index</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> is </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">fruit</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    # 輸出:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    # Index 0 is apple</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    # Index 1 is banana</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    # Index 2 is cherry</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"index\"><a href=\"#index\">index</a></h3>\n<p>使用<span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>index()</span></span></code></span> 獲取第一個的索引</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">numbers </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">10</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">20</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">30</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">20</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">40</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">index_of_20 </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> numbers.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">index</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">20</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(index_of_20)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 1</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"zip\"><a href=\"#zip\">zip</a></h3>\n<p>使用 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>zip()</span></span></code></span> 合併列表</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">names </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"Bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"Charlie\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">ages </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">25</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">30</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">35</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">for</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> name, age </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">in</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> zip</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(names, ages):</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">f</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> is </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">age</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> years old\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    # 輸出:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    # Alice is 25 years old</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    # Bob is 30 years old</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\">    # Charlie is 35 years old</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"hashmap\"><a href=\"#hashmap\">hashmap</a></h2>\n<p>其實python 要建立一個 hashmap 利用字典就可以</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 建立一個空的字典</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">hashmap </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> {}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"defaultdict\"><a href=\"#defaultdict\">defaultdict</a></h3>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>defaultdict</span></span></code></span> 是 <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>collections</span></span></code></span> 模組中的一個子類，用於當鍵不存在時提供默認值。</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">from</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> collections </span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">import</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> defaultdict</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 創建一個默認值為 list 的 defaultdict</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">dd </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> defaultdict</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">list</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">dd[</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'a'</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">].</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">dd[</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'b'</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">].</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">2</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(dd)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: defaultdict(&#x3C;class 'list'>, {'a': [1], 'b': [2]})</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 創建一個默認值為 int 的 defaultdict</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">dd </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> defaultdict</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">dd[</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'a'</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">dd[</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'b'</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(dd)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: defaultdict(&#x3C;class 'int'>, {'a': 1, 'b': 2})</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<h3 id=\"heapq\"><a href=\"#heapq\">heapq</a></h3>\n<p><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>heapq</span></span></code></span> 模組提供了堆隊列算法，也稱為優先隊列算法。</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">import</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> heapq</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 創建一個空堆</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">heap </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> []</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 向堆中添加元素</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">heapq.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">heappush</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(heap, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">3</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">heapq.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">heappush</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(heap, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">heapq.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">heappush</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(heap, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">2</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(heap)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: [1, 3, 2]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 從堆中取出最小元素</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">smallest </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> heapq.</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\">heappop</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(heap)</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(smallest)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(heap)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: [2, 3]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">a </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 10</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">b </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 5</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">c </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 加法</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">add_result </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> b</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">f</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> + </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">add_result</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 10 + 5 = 15</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 減法</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">sub_result </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> b</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">f</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> - </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">sub_result</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 10 - 5 = 5</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 乘法</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">mul_result </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">*</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> b</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">f</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> * </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">mul_result</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 10 * 5 = 50</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 除法</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">div_result </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">/</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> b</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">f</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> / </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">div_result</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 10 / 5 = 2.0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 整數除法</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">int_div_result </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">//</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> c</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">f</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> // </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">int_div_result</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 10 // 3 = 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 取餘數</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">mod_result </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">%</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> c</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">print</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">f</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> % </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">{</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">mod_result</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">}</span><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#7F848E;font-style:italic\"># 輸出: 10 % 3 = 1</span></span></code></pre></figure>"}